{"shortDescription":"Q2 Results Live Updates: The penultimate trading day of the week promises to be a day full of results from Nifty 50 and broader market companies as well as from companies that reported numbers after market hours on Wednesday. Asian Paints, Trent, Coal India, IndiGo, are the Nifty 50 names reporting…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Q2 Results Live Updates:"]}," The penultimate trading day of the week promises to be a day full of results from Nifty 50 and broader market companies as well as from companies that reported numbers after market hours on Wednesday. Asian Paints, Trent, Coal India, IndiGo, are the Nifty 50 names reporting numbers today. Broader market names such as Ambuja Cements, Blue Star, CAMS, Deepak Nitrite, EPack Durables, Godrej Consumer Products, Laurus Labs, Motilal Oswal, IEX, Pine Labs, Praj Industries, Strides Pharma, Welspun Corp, V-Guard, Suzlon Energy, Vedanta Power, and Titagarh Rail will also be reporting their results today. United Spirits, Bandhan Bank and Pidilite are most likely to be the most important result reactions of the day. Other companies such as Meesho, Vedanta Aluminium, RR Kabel, PNC Infratech, PNB Housing, Hero MotoCorp, Vaibhav Global, Zensar Tech, MAS Financial are some of the other result reactions that will be watched out for. Watch this space for all the LIVE Q2 result updates, management commentary, brokerage calls and all other updates."]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"CNBC TV18","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"cnbctv"}]},{"title":"Indian stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"IN"}]}],"id":"cnbctv:05906e233094b:0","title":"Q2 Results Live Updates: Suzlon, Asian Paints, Trent, Laurus report today; Vedanta, Hero react","published":1793239084,"urgency":2,"permission":"provider","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"NSE:ASIANPAINT","logoid":"asian-paints","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"asian-pai